inputtype=int
outputtype=string
outputstring=yes
defaultstr=Choose carefully!
valstr=0,The battle ends when all members of a team have been defeated. Fighters may not join or re-join the battle after it has begun.
valstr=1,The first team to score 25 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=2,The first team to score 50 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=3,The first team to score 100 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=4,The first team to score 200 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=5,The first team to score 500 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=6,The first team to score 1,000 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=7,The first team to score 5,000 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=8,The first team to score 10,000 kills will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=9,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 80 points will win.
valstr=10,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 250 points will win.
valstr=11,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 750 points will win.
valstr=12,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 1,500 points will win.
valstr=13,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 2,500 points will win.
valstr=14,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 4,000 points will win.
valstr=15,King of the Hill: The first team to hold the hills for 6,000 points will win.
valstr=16,Most kills: The team with the most kills after 5 minutes will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=17,Most kills: The team with the most kills after 10 minutes will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=18,Most kills: The team with the most kills after 20 minutes will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=19,Most kills: The team with the most kills after 60 minutes will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=20,Most kills: The team with the most kills after 120 minutes will win.<br>Fighters may enter the battle at any time.
valstr=21,Oddskull: The first team to hold the skull for 100 points will win.
valstr=22,Oddskull: The first team to hold the skull for 300 points will win.
valstr=23,Oddskull: The first team to hold the skull for 500 points will win.

