[enum_930]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
outputstring=yes
defaultstr=Choose carefully!
valstr=0,Wasteland - a dead land filled with lava, dead trees and rocks.
valstr=1,Plateau - a platform of rock amidst a sea of lava with very few obstacles.
valstr=2,Sylvan Glade - an arena filled with trees that block line-of-sight.
valstr=3,Forsaken Quarry - an arena filled with small rocks that do not block line-of-sight.
valstr=4,Turrets - rangers and mages may like to ascend the many turrets in this arena to fire down at targets below.
valstr=6,Soggy Swamp - a waterlogged marshland filled with roots and rotten trees.
valstr=7,Ghastly Swamp - like the soggy swamp, but with aggressive ghasts to rot your food or steal your health.
valstr=8,Northleach Quell - a snowy area filled with sunken boats and broken bits of wood.
valstr=5,Clan Cup Arena - adapted from the arena used in the 2013 Clan Cup.
valstr=9,Gridlock - a huge 4-way multi-mountain map suited for KoTH modes with rangers and mages.
valstr=10,Ethereal - A strange realm in the clouds, with teleports to use and destroy.
valstr=11,Classic -  The original Clan Wars Classic.
valstr=12,Lumbridge Castle - the iconic castle and its courtyard.
valstr=13,Falador Park - the historic battleground.

[enum_931]
inputtype=int
outputtype=int
default=-1
val=0,17
val=1,18
val=2,20
val=3,19
val=4,31

[enum_932]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
outputstring=yes
defaultstr=Choose carefully!
valstr=0,If freezing is ignored, spells such as Entangle and Ice Barrage will not prevent their targets from moving. Damage dealt by the spells will be applied normally.
valstr=1,In single-way combat areas, the PJ timer prevents players from being attacked for 10 secs after they have been attacking someone else.
valstr=2,If Single Spells is enabled, multi-target attacks (such as chinchompas) will hit only one target, even in multi-way combat areas.
valstr=3,Should Powered Staves and Wands be able to cast their spells on players? Normally they work only against monsters.
valstr=4,Should Vesta's Blighted Longsword be permitted in this battle? Normally it works only on specific worlds.

