valstr=30388,Lingering Lightning: Attack the target twice, if either attack hits spawn additional lightning wherever the npc was standing, dealing damage to targets around it.
valstr=30340,Crystalline Severance: Launch a powerful attack the pierces the Crystalline Hunllef's prayers and disables them briefly.
valstr=30759,Entice: Buffs yours and your allies next melee accuracy roll. Costs additional energy per ally affected.
valstr=30955,Flames of Ralos: Perform a devastating blow to your enemy with 50% increased accuracy and damage. If your attack successfully hits, the target will burn for 10 damage over 24 seconds.
valstr=31113,Soul Rend: Deliver a strike with doubled accuracy and 30% higher max hit, draining Magic Defence equal to the damage dealt.
valstr=31583,Rapid Burst: Fire two darts in rapid succession with 20% reduced accuracy and 10% increased damage.
valstr=33038,Power of the Gods: Launch an attack that applies each of the other godswords' effects. The ancient godsword blood sacrifice effects are reduced against players to 15 damage, 10 heal.
valstr=33041,Lightning Strike: Against monsters, attacks twice. If either attack is successful an additional lightning bolt is summoned rolling up to 100% of the original attacks max hit. Against players, increases damage by 30% and summons a barrage of lightning. Each lightning bolt hits between 30% and 45% of your original damage.
valstr=33035,Power of Death: Reduce all melee damage you receive by 50% for the next minute while the staff remains equipped. Stacks with Protect from Melee.
valstr=33036,Power of Death: Reduce all melee damage you receive by 50% for the next minute while the staff remains equipped. Stacks with Protect from Melee.
valstr=33243,Brand: Unleash 4 melee hits in quick succession with 25% increased max hit and accuracy.
valstr=33249,Ferocity: Unleash an instant attack on your target.
valstr=33255,Explosive Shatter: Consume 5 shatter stacks to instantly deal 150% of your max hit as magic damage and up to 75% as typeless damage to 12 enemies within 3 tiles
valstr=33722,Seeking Lunge: Always deals 70% of your maximum damage on a successful hit. If a monster has less health than this attack would deal, the attack always rolls exactly 70% of its maximum accuracy roll.
valstr=33631,Brutal Swing: Rolls accuracy 4 times. If any hit, the attacks deals 70-110% of your maximum hit. Each additional successful hit increases both the minimum and maximum hit by 20%

