[enum_2728]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
outputstring=yes
defaultstr=null
valstr=0,Leagues are time-limited game modes in which you can experience Old School RuneScape like never before!|Complete Tasks to earn League Points that can be used to unlock powerful Relics which enhance your gameplay!|Each League is different - figure out the best strategy to pull ahead of the competition. Or alternatively, just have fun!|Big thanks to the Gridmaster Competition winners who assisted with Relic design this league: InsaneWolfy, Jam & Viallinen.
valstr=1,In Leagues, League Points can be earned by completing various Tasks. These can then be used to unlock powerful Relics.|League Points are also transferred to your main game profile where they can be used to buy Rewards in the Leagues Reward Shop. This can be accessed from the Leagues Tutor in Lumbridge.
valstr=2,Relics are powerful buffs which affect your gameplay for the entire League. Choose carefully, because choices cannot be changed later!
valstr=3,Your performance in the League is measured by how many League Points you earn. And the more you score compared to your rivals, the higher League Rank you'll achieve!
valstr=4,As well as letting you unlock Relics, League Points are transferred to your main game profile.|Points can be used to buy rewards in the Leagues Reward Shop.|Performance in one League will also contribute to the next, with rewards such as:|- League Starter Outfits<br>- League Icons<br>- Pet Transfers

