defaultstr=
valstr=0,
valstr=1,<col=ffffff>Ahrim The Blighted:<br><br>Blighted Aura:<br><br>Magic Attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the enemy's strength level by 5 on a successful hit.<br><br>
valstr=2001,<col=ffffff>Ahrim The Blighted:<br><br>Blighted Aura +:<br><br>Magic Attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the enemy's strength level by 5 on a successful hit.<br><br>The spell also gets a 30% damage bonus.<br><br>
valstr=1901,<col=ffffff>Ahrim The Blighted:<br><br>Blighted Aura ++:<br><br>Magic Attacks have a 50% chance of lowering the enemy's strength level by 5 on a successful hit.<br><br>The spell also gets a 30% damage bonus.<br><br>
valstr=2,<col=ffffff>Dharok the Wretched:<br><br>Wretched Strength:<br><br>Attacks do more damage as your hitpoints decrease. For every hitpoint lost from your maximum hitpoints, you deal 1% more damage.<br><br>
valstr=2002,<col=ffffff>Dharok the Wretched:<br><br>Wretched Strength +:<br><br>Attacks do more damage as your hitpoints decrease. For every hitpoint lost from your maximum hitpoints, you deal 1% more damage.<br><br>When you take damage, you have a 1/4 chance of reflecting 15% of the damage to your opponent.<br><br>
valstr=1902,<col=ffffff>Dharok the Wretched:<br><br>Wretched Strength ++:<br><br>Attacks do more damage as your hitpoints decrease. For every hitpoint lost from your maximum hitpoints, you deal 2% more damage.<br><br>When you take damage, you have a 2/4 chance of reflecting 15% of the damage to your opponent.<br><br>
valstr=3,<col=ffffff>Guthan the Infested:<br><br>Infestation:<br><br>Attacks have a 25% chance of replenishing your health equal to the damage you deal.<br><br>
valstr=2003,<col=ffffff>Guthan the Infested:<br><br>Infestation +:<br><br>Attacks have a 25% chance of replenishing your health equal to the damage you deal.<br><br>This can boost your hitpoints by up to 10.<br><br>
valstr=1903,<col=ffffff>Guthan the Infested:<br><br>Infestation ++:<br><br>Attacks have a 50% chance of replenishing your health equal to the damage you deal.<br><br>This can boost your hitpoints by up to 10.<br><br>
valstr=4,<col=ffffff>Karil the Tainted:<br><br>Tainted Shot:<br><br>Successful range attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the enemy's agility stat by 20%.<br><br>
valstr=2004,<col=ffffff>Karil the Tainted:<br><br>Tainted Shot +:<br><br>Successful range attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the enemy's agility stat by 20%.<br><br>A second hitplat is applied in PvP, dealing half the damage of the first.<br><br>
valstr=1904,<col=ffffff>Karil the Tainted:<br><br>Tainted Shot ++:<br><br>Successful range attacks have a 50% chance of lowering the enemy's agility stat by 20%.<br><br>A second hitplat is applied in PvP, dealing half the damage of the first.<br><br>
valstr=5,<col=ffffff>Torag the Corrupted:<br><br>Corruption:<br><br>Successful melee attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the victim's run energy by 20%.<br><br>
valstr=2005,<col=ffffff>Torag the Corrupted:<br><br>Corruption +:<br><br>Successful melee attacks have a 25% chance of lowering the victim's run energy by 20%.<br><br>For every hitpoint lost from your maximum hitpoints, your Defence stat gets an invisible boost.<br><br>
valstr=1905,<col=ffffff>Torag the Corrupted:<br><br>Corruption ++:<br><br>Successful melee attacks have a 50% chance of lowering the victim's run energy by 20%.<br><br>For every hitpoint lost from your maximum hitpoints, your Defence stat gets an invisible boost.<br><br>
valstr=6,<col=ffffff>Verac the Defiled:<br><br>Defiler:<br><br>Attacks have a 25% chance of ignoring any armour, Defence, and protection prayers.<br><br>
valstr=2006,<col=ffffff>Verac the Defiled:<br><br>Defiler +:<br><br>Attacks have a 25% chance of ignoring any armour, Defence, and protection prayers.<br><br>Gives a +7 prayer bonus.<br><br>
valstr=1906,<col=ffffff>Verac the Defiled:<br><br>Defiler ++:<br><br>Attacks have a 50% chance of ignoring any armour, Defence, and protection prayers.<br><br>Gives a +14 prayer bonus.<br><br>
valstr=8,<col=ffffff>Graceful Outfit:<br><br>Each individual piece of the Graceful Outfit increases your run restoration rate.<br><br>Wearing the full Graceful Outfit increases run energy restoration by 30%.<br><br>
valstr=9,<col=ffffff>Obsidian armour:<br><br>All obsidian weaponry will be given a 10% boost in melee accuracy and melee strength.<br><br>
valstr=10,<col=ffffff>Void Knight Melee:<br><br>When wearing the Void Top, Robe, Gloves and Melee Helmet, you will receive +10% bonus to your melee damage and accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=11,<col=ffffff>Void Knight Range:<br><br>When wearing the Void Top, Robe, Gloves and Ranger Helmet, you will receive +10% bonus to your ranged damage and accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=12,<col=ffffff>Void Knight Elite Range:<br><br>When wearing the Elite Void Top, Elite Robe, Gloves and Ranger Helmet, you will receive +12.5% bonus to your ranged damage and 10% bonus to accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=13,<col=ffffff>Void Knight Mage:<br><br>When wearing the Void Top, Robe, Gloves and Mage Helmet, you will receive +45% bonus to your magic accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=14,<col=ffffff>Void Knight Elite Mage:<br><br>When wearing the Elite Void Top, Elite Robe, Gloves and Mage Helmet, you will receive a +45% bonus to your magic accuracy and 5% to your magic damage.<br><br>
valstr=15,<col=ffffff>Justiciar:<br><br>PvM damage dealt to you is reduced according to your total armour protection in that style.<br><br>
valstr=16,<col=ffffff>Angler outfit:<br><br>XP from training Fishing will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=17,<col=ffffff>Lumberjack outfit:<br><br>XP from training Woodcutting will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=18,<col=ffffff>Prospector outfit:<br><br>XP from training Mining will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=19,<col=ffffff>Farmer outfit:<br><br>XP from training Farming will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=20,<col=ffffff>Pyromancer outfit:<br><br>XP from training Firemaking will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=21,<col=ffffff>Shayzien armour:<br><br>Reduces the damage of the acid splash attack used by Lizardman Shamans.<br><br>
valstr=22,<col=ffffff>Rogue kit:<br><br>The full set gives a 100% chance of double loot from standard pickpocketing. Incomplete sets give smaller chances.<br><br>
valstr=23,<col=ffffff>Carpenter's outfit:<br><br>XP from training Construction will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>
valstr=24,<col=ffffff>Crystal armour:<br><br>Each individual piece of Crystal Armour increases your accuracy and damage with crystal ranged weaponry.<br><br>Wearing the full set of Crystal Armour increases accuracy by 30% and damage by 15%.<br><br>
valstr=25,<col=ffffff>Swampbark Armour:<br><br>Wearing the helm, body, and legs increases the duration of Bind, Snare and Entangle spells by 3.6 seconds<br><br>
valstr=26,<col=ffffff>Bloodbark Armour:<br><br>The full set increases the amount healed by Blood spells to 35.0%.<br><br>
valstr=27,<col=ffffff>Zealot's prayer robes:<br><br>The full set grants a 5% chance of saving ensouled heads when reanimating them, bones when burying or offering them, and bonemeal & slime at the Ectofuntus. This stacks with the Wilderness altar's bone saving effect.<br><br>
valstr=28,<col=ffffff>Spirit Angler outfit:<br><br>XP from training Fishing will be increased by 2.5% if the full set is worn. Incomplete sets give smaller bonuses.<br><br>Full set acts as a tether rope when fighting Tempoross.<br><br>
valstr=29,<col=ffffff>Virtus Robes:<br><br>6% increased Magic damage and an additional 9% increased Magic damage with ancient spells.<br><br>
valstr=30,<col=ffffff>Raiments of the Eye:<br><br>Runes crafted are increased by 60%.<br><br>This bonus stacks additively with other similar effects.<br><br>
valstr=31,<col=ffffff>Smith's Uniform:<br><br>The full set increases the rate you will smith items at an anvil by 1 tick.<br><br>
valstr=32,<col=ffffff>Statius's Equipment:<br><br>Melee special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=33,<col=ffffff>Vesta's Equipment:<br><br>Melee special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=34,<col=ffffff>Morrigan's Equipment:<br><br>Ranged special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=35,<col=ffffff>Zuriel's Equipment:<br><br>Magic special attacks have 25% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=36,<col=ffffff>Statius's Corrupt Equipment:<br><br>Melee special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=37,<col=ffffff>Vesta's Corrupt Equipment:<br><br>Melee special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=38,<col=ffffff>Morrigan's Corrupt Equipment:<br><br>Ranged special attacks have 15% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=39,<col=ffffff>Zuriel's Corrupt Equipment:<br><br>Magic special attacks have 25% increased accuracy.<br><br>
valstr=40,<col=ffffff>Bloodrager Effect:<br><br>Successful hits with the Dual Macuahuitl have a 33% chance of reducing the delay of your next attack by 1 tick.<br><br>The Dual Macuahuitl gains the 'Blood Infusion' special attack.<br><br>
valstr=41,<col=ffffff>Frostweaver Effect:<br><br>Casting spells which bind the enemy has a 50% chance to allow the next attack with the Blue moon spear to bypass the action delay.<br><br>The Blue Moon Spear gains the 'Break Shackles' special attack.<br><br>
valstr=42,<col=ffffff>Frostweaver Effect Set:<br><br>Casting spells which bind the enemy has a 20% chance to allow the next attack with the Blue moon spear to bypass the action delay.<br><br>The Blue Moon Spear gains the 'Break Shackles' special attack.<br><br>
valstr=43,<col=ffffff>Eclipse Effect:<br><br>Successful hits with the Eclipse Atlatl have a 20% chance to apply a burn effect to the enemy.<br><br>The Eclipse Atlatl gains the 'Eclipse' special attack.<br><br>
valstr=44,<col=ffffff>Hunter's Armour:<br><br>Damage taken from hunter creatures is reduced by 60%.<br><br>
valstr=45,<col=ffffff>Hunter's Armour:<br><br>Damage taken from hunter creatures is reduced by 40%.<br><br>
valstr=46,<col=ffffff>Hunter's Armour:<br><br>Damage taken from hunter creatures is reduced by 20%.<br><br>
valstr=47,<col=ffffff>Guild Hunter Outfit:<br><br>Increases catch chance of hunter creatures by up to 2.5%, and increases rare creature part droprate when doing Hunters' Rumours by up to 5%.<br><br>
valstr=48,<col=ffffff>Inquisitor's armour:<br><br>Each individual piece of Inquisitor's armour boosts damage and accuracy by 2.5% when using the crush attack style and having the Inquisitor's mace equipped.<br><br>

