[enum_3823]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
outputstring=yes
defaultstr=If by my life or death I can protect you, I will. You have my sword.
valstr=0,
valstr=1,Timelessly fashionable. The helmet of a champion.
valstr=2,Not all who wander are lost.
valstr=3,A good tool improves the way you work. A great tool improves the way you think.
valstr=4,Party time! Excellent.
valstr=5,Ashes to ashes. Dust to dust. Bones to experience.
valstr=6,It is our choices that show us what we truly are. Far more than our abilities.
valstr=7,Go in peace in the name of Saradomin; may his glory shine upon you like the sun.
valstr=8,Give a noob a fish and they will leave you alone. Teach a noob to fish and they will deflate the fish market.
valstr=9,Life's biggest tragedy is that we get old too soon and wise too late.
valstr=10,Follow it. You'll be happier.
valstr=11,Rise and rise again, until lambs become lions.
valstr=12,May your bloodthirst never be sated, and may all your battles be glorious. Zamorak bring you strength.
valstr=13,Life is a garden. You reap what you sow.
valstr=14,A day without laughter is a day wasted.
valstr=15,If by my life or death I can protect you, I will. You have my sword.
valstr=16,Aim steady. Perfection is unattainable, but one should always strive for it.
valstr=17,May you walk the path, and never fall, for Guthix walks beside thee on thy journey. May Guthix bring you peace.
valstr=18,Pawschamp?
valstr=19,Cats are easily as tough as sheep. Cats were the second thing Guthix brought here, after sheep of course.
valstr=20,Stand and deliver!
valstr=21,The shield that guards the realms of men.
valstr=22,Brassica Prime. Thy Name be Vegetable, thy land be soil. Plant in us thy seeds of faith, that we may grow beyond allotments. Forever, your crops. Cabbage.
valstr=23,A rose in the grey.
valstr=24,You must really like your clan if you put a ring on it.
valstr=25,A risky life, to be marked by Him. Though a skulled adventurer need not fear when their clan is near.
valstr=26,By the way.
valstr=27,Ultimately, you stand alone.

